","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/deployments","created_at":"2016-11-13T23:02:13Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T09:18:18Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-10T21:49:12Z","git_url":"git://github.com/forem/forem.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:forem/forem.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/forem/forem.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/forem/forem","homepage":"https://forem.com","size":1725259,"stargazers_count":22543,"watchers_count":22543,"language":"Ruby","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":4153,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":555,"license":{"key":"agpl-3.0","name":"GNU Affero General Public License v3.0","spdx_id":"AGPL-3.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/agpl-3.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["community","discussion","feedback","hacktoberfest","open-source","rails","ruby"],"visibility":"public","forks":4153,"open_issues":555,"watchers":22543,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/pulls/22509","html_url":"https://github.com/forem/forem/pull/22509","diff_url":"https://github.com/forem/forem/pull/22509.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/forem/forem/pull/22509.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-31T20:22:43Z"},"body":"#  Fix faded Like button and tooltip stacking issue after replying to your own comment\r\n\r\n##  Type of PR\r\n- [x] **Bug Fix**  \r\n- [ ] Refactor  \r\n- [ ] Feature  \r\n- [ ] Optimization  \r\n- [ ] Documentation Update  \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##  Description\r\nWhen you reply to a comment on your own post, the **Like button** in the parent comment could appear **faded**, and its **tooltip** might render **behind** the newly inserted reply.  \r\n\r\nThis happened because the inline-reply flow added a `.replying` class to `.comment__details`, but the code responsible for closing the reply form was attempting to remove `.replying` from `.inner-comment`. The stale `.replying` class kept the footer hidden until a page reload.\r\n\r\n###  Fix Summary\r\nThis change includes two small fixes:\r\n1. **Fixes the selector in `handleFormClose`** — now removes `.replying` from the correct container (`.comment__details`).\r\n2. **Adds `position: relative`** to the Like button activator markup to ensure the tooltip uses a proper stacking context.\r\n\r\nA **focused system spec** has been added to cover this behavior and prevent regressions.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##  Related Tickets & Documents\r\n- Fixes issue: **#22479**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##  QA Instructions, Screenshots, Recordings\r\n\r\n###  How to Reproduce the Original Issue (Before Fix)\r\n1. Go to one of your own posts with comments.  \r\n2. Open the inline reply form for a comment.  \r\n3. Submit a reply.  \r\n4. Observe that the **parent comment footer remains faded**, and the **Like tooltip** can be hidden behind the reply.  \r\n5. Reloading the page restores the proper appearance.\r\n\r\n###  How to Verify This Fix (Manual)\r\n1. Start the app and load an article with comments.  \r\n2. Reply to a comment inline and submit it.  \r\n3. Verify that:\r\n   - The **parent comment footer (Like button)** remains visible and not faded.\r\n   - Hovering the Like button shows the tooltip **above** the reply content.\r\n\r\n###  How to Verify This Fix (Automated)\r\nRun the new system spec:\r\n```bash\r\nbundle exec rspec spec/system/comments/like_button_state_after_reply_spec.rb\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##  Browsers / Devices\r\nThis is a **DOM/state fix** and should behave consistently across all modern browsers.  \r\nOriginally reported environment: **Chrome on macOS**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##  UI Accessibility Checklist\r\n- [x] Semantic HTML preserved  \r\n- [x] Keyboard operability unchanged  \r\n- [ ] (Optional) Recommend a quick **axe** accessibility check for completeness  \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##  Added / Updated Tests\r\n-  **Yes** — added `spec/system/comments/like_button_state_after_reply_spec.rb`  \r\n  - Verifies that `.comment__details` no longer has the `.replying` class after submitting a reply.  \r\n  - Confirms that the footer Like button remains visible.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##  Post-Deployment Tasks\r\n- None.\r\n\r\n---\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/22509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/22509/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":20642638280,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBGPKJs7SytwpzwAAAATOZanI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/events/20642638280","actor":{"login":"benhalpern","id":3102842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDI4NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3102842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern","html_url":"https://github.com/benhalpern","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benhalpern/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"a9058a2fd70f0cd1737eefb252f86bd43841b76e","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/commits/a9058a2fd70f0cd1737eefb252f86bd43841b76e","created_at":"2025-10-31T20:22:44Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":20651532153,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBGPKJs7SytwpzwAAAATO7V95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/events/20651532153","actor":{"login":"TERNOX","id":43003712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDAzNzEy","